WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.600
imaginando

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.200
cake covered in frosting?

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.920
Why would I?

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.680
There is something much

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.840
sweeter right in front of me.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.680
What's wrong, Curly Pie?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.680
You don't like it?

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.120
No. It's just...

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.480
there were too many

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.640
emotions today and...

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.560
we might do something

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:39.440
stupid.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.800
So I took that damn

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.680
bullet for nothing.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:45.880
Right?

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.840
So, uhm...

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.360
Isn't it also a part of

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:54.960
getting to know each other?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.240
Yeah.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.200
We need to know each other

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.560
on a very deep level.
